flowchart TD
    A[Eval Dataset] --> B[Eval Questions]
    B --> C[Start Dataset Run]
    C --> D[For each question]

    D --> E[Project-scoped retrieval]
    E --> F{Reranker enabled?}
    F -->|yes| G[Apply local reranker]
    F -->|no| H[Use retrieval ranking]
    G --> I[Compute retrieval hit]
    H --> I

    I --> J[Generate cited answer]
    J --> K[Compute citation coverage]
    J --> L[Detect refusal behavior]
    J --> M[Match expected answer notes]
    M --> N{LLM judge enabled?}
    N -->|yes| O[Judge answer quality]
    N -->|no| P[Skip judge]

    K --> Q[Store eval result]
    L --> Q
    M --> Q
    O --> Q
    P --> Q

    Q --> R{More questions?}
    R -->|yes| D
    R -->|no| S[Aggregate run metrics]
    S --> T[Store eval run]
    T --> U[Run history]
    U --> V[Run compare]
    U --> W[CSV or JSON export]

    X[Chat request] --> Y[Retrieval log]
    X --> Z[Chat request metric]
    Y --> AA[Metrics page links]
    Z --> AB[Metrics summary]
    Z --> AC[Recent request list]

    subgraph Isolation[Project Isolation]
        P1[dataset.project_id]
        P2[question.project_id]
        P3[run.project_id]
        P4[result.project_id]
        P5[metric.project_id]
    end

    C -. validate .-> P1
    D -. validate .-> P2
    T -. store .-> P3
    Q -. store .-> P4
    Z -. store .-> P5
